  "note": [
    "The Transportation Supply's fabric (DR-106), cut from the one Kalamontee layout in scripts/fabric-kalamontee.mjs -- regenerate from there, do not hand-edit. TRANSPORTATION-SUPPLY.metadata.json: 5 x 3.2 x 5, the eye at the middle, one 1.6 x 2.4 portal south onto Admin Corridor North; no fittings and no light of its own.",
    "The room is dark (no ONBIT, compone.zil 1195; its LDESC is \"You have just located a serious bug\"): the game says \"It is pitch black ... There is light to the south\" (verbs.zil 70-73). Its paintings show it lit by the lamp the player carries, so this scene is lit that way: a warm light at the eye, with no housing; the dark itself is the engine's to draw. South through the portal, lit, Admin Corridor North, the rift open to the sky and the one corridor line on south to the Junction."
